  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bcdc8b5344ba8035",
      "translationZh": "编辑视频是一系列创意和技术决策的连续过程。编辑者需要塑造故事、放置音效、构建转场、调整颜色等等。Invideo（打开新窗口）是一种旨在处理这些工作同时让人类编辑保持控制的智能体视频编辑器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5188a86cbaf32268",
      "translationZh": "借助 GPT‑6 Astra，Invideo 在规划和执行复杂编辑以及在时间轴上正确位置放置更改方面展现出更强的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5ad4175370005f7",
      "translationZh": "“Astra 能够以帧级精度规划特定编辑这一点相当令人惊叹。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b29f2f2b3028753",
      "translationZh": "—Sanket Shah，Invideo 首席执行官",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22d639511c8de44c",
      "translationZh": "规划复杂编辑并保持简洁",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ee5de82a5ead8e8",
      "translationZh": "AI 代理必须将编辑的指令转化为一系列步骤，选择合适的工具，执行工作并验证结果。Sanket 表示，GPT‑6 Astra 能够比其之前测试的模型使用更少的推理步骤来规划这些操作：“Astra 使用了远少得多的推理集，因而输出的令牌更少，以完成复杂工作。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6894b1cd283c9cb",
      "translationZh": "Invideo 还观察到，Astra 能够在任务变得更长更复杂时，执行多条指令而不丢失编辑器的原始目标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe215f706d477947",
      "translationZh": "选择正确的方法并适应变化",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d35c2cbe8c46cf0c",
      "translationZh": "GPT‑6 Astra 在色彩工作方面尤为有效，此时代理需要从诸如校正、分级、重生、LUT 和隔离等重叠的方法中进行选择。例如，在保持人物肤色不变的情况下更改背景，需要代理先隔离并跟踪人物在各帧中的位置，然后再在其他地方应用颜色。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "202085754d82cc74",
      "translationZh": "Sanket 表示：“早在之前，我们看到色彩分级和色彩校正任务的失败率非常高。使用 Astra 后，成功率提高了大约三倍。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5c764c12126b982b",
      "translationZh": "创建完全可编辑的自定义效果",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56902ded6918fff5",
      "translationZh": "GPT‑6 Astra 还能帮助 Invideo 将描述和视觉参考转化为自定义效果。代理可以根据素材编写效果代码，将其放置在时间线上，并添加控件，使编辑器能够对其进行细化。一天内，少数 Invideo 编辑使用该模型创建了大约 50 个效果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1542d942548fa2c3",
      "translationZh": "使用带有 GPT‑6 Astra 的 Invideo 代理，创意专业人员可以在不花费大量时间进行繁琐的分镜规划和逐帧工作的情况下，保留对故事、个人品味以及最终成片的控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
